{"caveats":[],"characterization":[],"evidence":[{"char_end":1137,"char_start":991,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67141,"document_char_start":66995,"evidence_id":"ev_d448c77edcd936fd","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"A zero-gap alkaline water electrolyzer was assembled using PSCFM/NF and Pt/C/NF as the anode and cathode, respectively (NF refers to nickel foam).","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1267,"char_start":1138,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67271,"document_char_start":67142,"evidence_id":"ev_3ac95a02dc13627c","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"Electrochemical measurements were performed at room temperature using a CHI 760E electrochemical workstation (Chenhua, Shanghai).","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1453,"char_start":1268,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67457,"document_char_start":67272,"evidence_id":"ev_8313f0e7b5d9919f","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"The catalyst ink was prepared by dispersing 10 mg of catalyst powder in 1 mL of anhydrous ethanol and 50 μLof anion exchange ionomer (Fumion FAA-3-SOLUT-10, FuMA-Tech) using sonication.","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1590,"char_start":1454,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67594,"document_char_start":67458,"evidence_id":"ev_9954d3a414af14b6","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"The catalyst ink was then drop-coated onto the surface of the NF electrodes to achieve desired mass loadings of 1 mg cm −2 and 3mgcm −2.","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1788,"char_start":1719,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67792,"document_char_start":67723,"evidence_id":"ev_41c5f027d3bce3